\title{Retained BioGeoBEARS compatibility interface}
\description{The exported legacy modelling, input, optimization, mapping,
plotting, and helper functions are retained for compatible analysis scripts.
The unified Rust engine accelerates supported numerical kernels.}
\details{For established workflow examples and methodological attribution,
consult the original BioGeoBEARS documentation at
\url{http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears} and the package tutorials.
This index preserves discoverability of legacy public names; it does not imply
that every legacy model combination is validated by the new uncertainty tools.

